<title>THAILAND: Land and Houses sets one baht 1996 div.</title>
<headline>Land and Houses sets one baht 1996 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  1.00    vs     5.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 8, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 28, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE: Land and Houses Plc is a property developer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-652-0642)</p>
</text>
